# H40P / product alias map: KEY<TAB><overlay-basename>
# Values MUST name a real .dts/.dtbo under this board's dt/ (canonical name,
# not a same-dir legacy alias). Consumed by ldto (MAP_ALIAS_DT).
# v01 stub tree (opp + spifc only); header accessories use aml-s905d3-cc / a311d shared map
# No H40P slot is served here: enable cpu-opp-2208 / spifc-nor by their
# overlay names.

# DSI connector 0. Same panel overlay as Cottonwood. Pin 17 is GPIOA_13
# on the Solitude sheet and is not claimed.
DSI_0_LCD_7_RPI	dsi-0-rpi-7inch
